; determines its draw priority. The first legend category has the highest
; priority and the last has the lowest priority. You *must* recompile
; if you change the number and/or order of legend items to get SIMPL to
; draw the new items properly.
;
; Color
;   - Specifies the color associated with this category
;   - The format is R, G, B, A
